  "description": "Forms and email marketing for Umbraco 17, native to the Bellissima backoffice. Build forms, manage submissions, grow mailing lists, and design and send on-brand campaigns, automated content digests, and transactional email — with a native Block Grid email editor, GDPR tooling, a headless submission API, and built-in deliverability checks. Bring your own email provider: SendGrid, Postmark, Mailgun, Resend, or SMTP.",
